{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-powerup#card-zh","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-powerup","commit":"ed53c1eb12cba84edcd7fd9bd7cb819ddf8d5487","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Power-Up 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 网页客户端的增强插件，在轨迹页面提供右键操作菜单，并加入侧边栏图标启动器、后台任务停止原因填写和插件版本安装面板。用户可以复制或引用轨迹记录、查看详情、从记录分叉会话、导出轨迹 JSON，也可复制步骤引用供 Agent 读取原始事件。插件还支持从已配置的注册源查看版本、安装指定版本并按设置启用或重启。适合需要管理会话轨迹、插件和侧边栏面板的 DSH 用户；无需额外 API 密钥，注册表查询使用客户端配置的源。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2215","client.js:5874-5890","index.js:473-496"]}
{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-powerup#card-en","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-powerup","commit":"ed53c1eb12cba84edcd7fd9bd7cb819ddf8d5487","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Power-Up adds a trajectory menu, sidebar launcher, job stop reasons, and plugin installer to the DeepSeek Harness web client. Users can quote, fork, inspect, or export records, and copy step references for agents to read session data. It installs selected plugin versions from configured registries.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2215","client.js:5874-5890","index.js:473-496"]}
