{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-powerup#feature-1","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-powerup","commit":"ed53c1eb12cba84edcd7fd9bd7cb819ddf8d5487","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Power-Up 的功能「轨迹记录右键操作」：在轨迹记录上打开菜单，可复制文本或 Markdown 引用、插入输入框、查看详情、从该处 Fork，并复制步骤引用。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2215","client.js:2300"]}
